  "setup": "Recovered compatibility client 1.16.5.0 with copied deployed-derived Game/world, copied accepted-1995 character at Youngblood-area login position (93.2,115.0,137.5), normal hostile stats/AI. Both starts have mission 1995 already accepted; no same-session Youngblood acceptance is claimed. No player coordinate, combat-stat, objective, or timer edits during either run. The live Game/DIT service and databases were untouched.",
