      "finding": "Run 1 entered playable client with Calling for Reinforcements objective 2 active, level 2, 8695 XP and 360 credits at the copied accepted-mission checkpoint."
    },
    {
      "tier": "observed",
      "source_location": "output/02-west-gate-loc.png through 05-gate-after-fire-2.png; output/game.log around 06:38:34-06:38:38 America/Chicago",
      "finding": "Normal client movement and rifle fire killed west-gate placement 198674 after seven logged 106-damage hits; copied character gained 71 XP and 10 credits, retaining objective 2 active."
    },
    {
      "tier": "measured",
      "source_location": "output/10-west-endcap-loc.png through 15-w3.png, original-client /loc overlay; output/command-trace.tar.gz",
      "uncertainty": "Displayed position rounded to 0.1 m. Input heading and collision varied; no complete high-frequency movement trace.",
      "finding": "In the same client session, ordinary movement went around the fence/panel and along the outer trench to (-94.5,85.2,67.5), within the inferred wounded-soldier bunker area. The character was alive with objective 2 active at the last location capture."
    },
    {
      "tier": "observed",
      "source_location": "output/game.log line containing 06:47:46.108 America/Chicago death; output/16-d12.png; output/17-final-respawn.png; output/char-after-death.db",
      "finding": "Before wounded-soldier dialogue, the player died at (-94.5,85.2,67.5), killed by creature 2760 class 29769 at (-85,86.3,91); the copied character respawned at hospital (357.9,120.3,156.5) with 8766 XP/370 credits, and objective 2 remained active. The controller spent time inspecting the route under fire, so this is not a calibrated survival or balance measurement."
    },
    {
      "tier": "inferred",
      "source_location": "copied world.db creature 198513 and content_placement 198683",
      "finding": "The killing creature is the currently seeded Thrax Infantry Initiate L1 (1995 outpost), class 29769, 555 health, at placement 198683 (-85,86.33,91.03). This identifies emulator rows, not proof of original final-live values."
