    {
      "tier": "observed",
      "source_location": "output2/02-gate.png through 04-fence-panel.png; output2/game.log around 06:51:24 America/Chicago; output2/char-after-gate-death.db",
      "finding": "Run 2 began from the restored same accepted-1995 baseline. The fixed gate firing angle missed the moving hostile (no XP/credits gained); that hostile pursued and killed the character at (0.3,99.3,130.8) before the lower route. The focus guard correctly withheld a later move on the death UI. No soldier interaction occurred."
    },
