  "assessment": "The accepted-1995 checkpoint can continuously clear the first gate and traverse the reconstructed outer path to the wounded-soldier vicinity with normal hostile behavior. The first run died before objective 2 interaction; the second failed the first moving-target fight. Full gate-to-soldier dialogue, soldier-to-corpse use, and combined timed completion remain unverified. These are emulator functionality observations, not final-live enemy-stat or route fidelity proof.",
